# MarkiThon Development Rules

- Business name: **Ammad Hadi Stor**. Use this in UI labels, seeds, and demo data.
- Language: ALL code, UI, comments, logs, and API messages in English only. No Urdu or Roman Urdu.
- Max 250 lines per file. Split into reusable helpers, CSS, and JS modules.
- Reuse shared JS/CSS. Do not duplicate layout or fetch logic.
- UI: Screen 1 dark theme (`#0b1120` background, `#161f36` glass cards, blue glow on active nav).
- Mobile: sidebar, grids, forms, and tables must work on small screens.
- Inspect only files needed for the current task. Do not scan the whole repo.
